<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/7/msa@/~cl_4__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "dengan memasukkan selepas takrif “Board” takrif yang berikut: ‘ “Chief Executive Officer” means the Chief Executive Officer of the Authority appointed under section 3D;’;"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/7/msa@> .
